# Example BPF filters for mirror NIC
# Apply via CAPTURE_BPF_FILTER or config/sensor.yaml capture.bpf_filter
# IEC 61850 details: docs/sprint-s1-02b-iec61850.md

# Modbus TCP only
# port 502

# IEC 61850 — GOOSE (L2) + MMS (TCP/102)  [S1-02b lab default]
# (ether proto 0x88b8) or (tcp port 102)

# IEC 61850 — GOOSE only
# ether proto 0x88b8

# IEC 61850 — MMS only
# tcp port 102

# Exclude SV (not in S1-02b scope) while keeping GOOSE + MMS
# (ether proto 0x88b8 or tcp port 102) and not ether proto 0x88ba

# OT lab mixed: 61850 + Modbus (higher CPU on Pi4)
# (ether proto 0x88b8) or (tcp port 102) or (tcp port 502)

# OT subnet only
# net 192.168.10.0/24

# Exclude broadcast noise (avoid on GOOSE-heavy capture — GOOSE uses L2 multicast)
# not broadcast
